# Blitz Chrome Extension — Cursor Prompt File
# Full build spec. Read this entire file before writing any code.

---

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

Build a Chrome Extension (Manifest V3) called **Blitz** that helps users automatically tailor and submit job applications across multiple platforms. The extension:

- Detects when a user is on a supported job listing page
- Scrapes the job description
- Uses an LLM (via the user's own API key) to generate a tailored CV and cover letter
- Shows a review/approve UI before any form interaction
- Auto-fills and submits the application on approval

Target platforms (in priority order):
1. Greenhouse (most consistent form structure — build this first)
2. LinkedIn Easy Apply
3. Indeed
4. Workday (deprioritise — complex Shadow DOM, tackle last)

Distribution: Chrome Web Store
Monetisation: Freemium — 15 free applications, then paid tier via LemonSqueezy license key
AI: BYOK (Bring Your Own Key) — user supplies their Anthropic or OpenAI API key

